==Description==
'''Oops all slimes!''' is a [[Modifiers|modifier]] that only appears in the [[Oops! All slimes!]] challenge. It gives the [[Slime (Attribute)|Slime]] attribute to all enemies. To compensate, starting cash is increased, and early waves spawn less enemies than usual.

==Effects==
The main change in this challenge is all enemies are given the [[Slime (Attribute)|Slime]] attribute, meaning all enemies will spawn a [[Slime]] upon death.

==Trivia==
*The title is a reference to the ''oops! All berries'' cereal.
*This is the only the [[Modifiers|modifier]] that does not have the first letter of each word capitalized.

